-- Centralised Onboarding — strengthen division Terms & Conditions to v2.
-- Appends universal clauses (electronic acceptance & IT Act validity, company/grievance
-- details, DPDP Act data protection, payment security & default, GST/TDS indemnity,
-- cancellation & refund, anti-bribery/AML/sanctions, non-solicitation, assignment,
-- notices, limitation of claims, dispute resolution & amendments) plus division-specific
-- clauses (hospital: site/statutory approvals/equipment; interiors: site readiness/price
-- variation), and bumps version to 2026-08-05-v2. This file mirrors the state applied to
-- production via migration 20260805095000 and is idempotent for replay from the v1 seed.

